# Accepted Trivy findings (container scan). Each needs a reason and a way out.

# deepmerge-ts 7.1.5 is pulled in by the Prisma CLI (@prisma/config, every 6.x
# release pins ^7.1.5). The stack exhaustion needs a recursive object graph
# passed to deepmerge; Prisma only merges its own config file at CLI start
# (the migrate task), never request data. Drop this line once Prisma ships a
# release that depends on deepmerge-ts >= 8.
CVE-2026-40345
